Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:22:12 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720] | Words: 16 | Text: 你有没有发现站里的你往往过的并不顺心
Segment #2   [00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,500] | Words: 10 | Text: 人与人最终的阶层差距
Segment #3   [00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,160] | Words: 8  | Text: 格局差距成就差距
Segment #4   [00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,780] | Words: 13 | Text: 表面看是能力资源运气的差距
Segment #5   [00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,780] | Words: 12 | Text: 本质是决策思维维度的差距
Segment #6   [00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,000] | Words: 6  | Text: 底层人论对错
Segment #7   [00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,100] | Words: 6  | Text: 终层人论得失
Segment #8   [00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,740] | Words: 8  | Text: 顶层人论长远利弊
Segment #9   [00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,000] | Words: 18 | Text: 今天我彻底拆解这两种思维的底层运行逻辑
Segment #10  [00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,360] | Words: 6  | Text: 让你彻底通通
Segment #11  [00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:20,160] | Words: 1  | Text: 首先
Segment #12  [00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,640] | Words: 12 | Text: 针对错是最低为的情绪思维
Segment #13  [00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,680] | Words: 11 | Text: 喜欢纠结对错非要分出书赢
Segment #14  [00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,240] | Words: 8  | Text: 非要证明自己没错的人
Segment #15  [00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,920] | Words: 9  | Text: 做所有决策的核心依据
Segment #16  [00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,160] | Words: 6  | Text: 是情绪和面子
Segment #17  [00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,280] | Words: 6  | Text: 不是实施和目标
Segment #18  [00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,580] | Words: 5  | Text: 对错思维的人
Segment #19  [00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,100] | Words: 7  | Text: 潜意是只有一个诉求
Segment #20  [00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,540] | Words: 6  | Text: 我要证明我是对的
Segment #21  [00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,400] | Words: 5  | Text: 对方是错的
Segment #22  [00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,140] | Words: 10 | Text: 为了这个虚无的情绪满足
Segment #23  [00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,780] | Words: 10 | Text: 愿意付出巨大的现实代价
Segment #24  [00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,080] | Words: 6  | Text: 你仔细观察生活
Segment #25  [00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,780] | Words: 9  | Text: 很多人因为一句口舌之争
Segment #26  [00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,100] | Words: 6  | Text: 消耗半天情绪
Segment #27  [00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,420] | Words: 6  | Text: 因为一点小事对错
Segment #28  [00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,480] | Words: 6  | Text: 消耗人机关系
Segment #29  [00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,560] | Words: 6  | Text: 因为别人不同观点
Segment #30  [00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,320] | Words: 4  | Text: 纠结内号
Segment #31  [00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,120] | Words: 4  | Text: 彻野难免
Segment #32  [00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:49,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 为了征一个书营
Segment #33  [00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,060] | Words: 4  | Text: 征一个面子
Segment #34  [00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,100] | Words: 6  | Text: 征一个理智气状
Segment #35  [00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:51,840] | Words: 3  | Text: 浪费时间
Segment #36  [00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,660] | Words: 4  | Text: 消耗经历
Segment #37  [00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,520] | Words: 4  | Text: 措施机会
Segment #38  [00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,520] | Words: 4  | Text: 破坏格局
Segment #39  [00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,480] | Words: 11 | Text: 这就是对错思维的致命漏洞
Segment #40  [00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,680] | Words: 11 | Text: 把解决问题变成了汉为自我
Segment #41  [00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:00,580] | Words: 10 | Text: 原本的目标是把事做好
Segment #42  [00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:01,540] | Words: 4  | Text: 把问题解决
Segment #43  [00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:03,340] | Words: 9  | Text: 最后变成了汉为自尊
Segment #44  [00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:04,420] | Words: 4  | Text: 纠结书营
Segment #45  [00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:05,520] | Words: 6  | Text: 陷入情绪对抗
Segment #46  [00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,900] | Words: 6  | Text: 看似赢了口舌
Segment #47  [00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:07,700] | Words: 4  | Text: 赢了道理
Segment #48  [00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:08,680] | Words: 5  | Text: 实责输了时间
Segment #49  [00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:09,380] | Words: 4  | Text: 输了人脉
Segment #50  [00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,140] | Words: 4  | Text: 输了格局
Segment #51  [00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:11,360] | Words: 7  | Text: 输了人生选择权
Segment #52  [00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:12,520] | Words: 5  | Text: 而利毕思维
Segment #53  [00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,120] | Words: 9  | Text: 是最高为的目标思维
Segment #54  [00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,180] | Words: 5  | Text: 真正的强者
Segment #55  [00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:16,960] | Words: 11 | Text: 早已跳出对错的低级博弈
Segment #56  [00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,060] | Words: 5  | Text: 他们做任何事
Segment #57  [00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,120] | Words: 5  | Text: 面对任何人
Segment #58  [00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,040] | Words: 5  | Text: 处理任何问题
Segment #59  [00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:21,520] | Words: 8  | Text: 大脑自动平毕情绪
Segment #60  [00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:23,320] | Words: 11 | Text: 只开启三个核心违度判断
Segment #61  [00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:23,980] | Words: 1  | Text: 第一
Segment #62  [00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:26,680] | Words: 13 | Text: 这件事是否有利于我的长期目标
Segment #63  [00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:27,420] | Words: 1  | Text: 第二
Segment #64  [00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:28,360] | Words: 4  | Text: 继续纠缠
Segment #65  [00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:30,240] | Words: 10 | Text: 我要消耗多少不可再生资源
Segment #66  [00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:32,400] | Words: 7  | Text: 时间 经历 人脉 心态
Segment #67  [00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,080] | Words: 1  | Text: 第三
Segment #68  [00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,940] | Words: 8  | Text: 放下纠结 优化选择
Segment #69  [00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:37,000] | Words: 9  | Text: 有没有更高收益的方案
Segment #70  [00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,380] | Words: 7  | Text: 利毕思维的核心
Segment #71  [00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:40,260] | Words: 9  | Text: 是目标永远大于情绪
Segment #72  [00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:42,020] | Words: 8  | Text: 结果永远大于面子
Segment #73  [00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:43,560] | Words: 6  | Text: 强者不是部分是非
Segment #74  [00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,480] | Words: 4  | Text: 不是没有底线
Segment #75  [00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 而是他们清楚
Segment #76  [00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,120] | Words: 12 | Text: 是非藏在心里行动服从结果
Segment #77  [00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,840] | Words: 7  | Text: 心理清楚黑白对错
Segment #78  [00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,180] | Words: 11 | Text: 但行为永远为自己的人生负责
Segment #79  [00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,060] | Words: 9  | Text: 我在讲头一个绝大多数人
Segment #80  [00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:55,200] | Words: 6  | Text: 不懂的人性真相
Segment #81  [00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,060] | Words: 3  | Text: 认知不同
Segment #82  [00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:56,900] | Words: 4  | Text: 无法变营
Segment #83  [00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:58,100] | Words: 8  | Text: 人和人的认知曾经
Segment #84  [00:01:58,100 --> 00:01:58,820] | Words: 4  | Text: 跃离格局
Segment #85  [00:01:58,820 --> 00:02:00,160] | Words: 6  | Text: 思维模型完全不同
Segment #86  [00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,360] | Words: 6  | Text: 你和低认知的人
Segment #87  [00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:01,960] | Words: 3  | Text: 争对错
Segment #88  [00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,200] | Words: 7  | Text: 本身就是最大的错误
Segment #89  [00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,180] | Words: 5  | Text: 你说服不了他
Segment #90  [00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:05,240] | Words: 6  | Text: 他只会消耗你
Segment #91  [00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,240] | Words: 5  | Text: 争变得最后
Segment #92  [00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,000] | Words: 3  | Text: 没有赢家
Segment #93  [00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,140] | Words: 5  | Text: 只有双想消耗
Segment #94  [00:02:08,580 --> 00:02:09,740] | Words: 8  | Text: 成年人的顶级通透
Segment #95  [00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:11,300] | Words: 9  | Text: 就是主动退出对错博弈
Segment #96  [00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,220] | Words: 3  | Text: 不解释
Segment #97  [00:02:12,220 --> 00:02:12,960] | Words: 3  | Text: 不辩论
Segment #98  [00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,780] | Words: 3  | Text: 不纠缠
Segment #99  [00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:14,680] | Words: 4  | Text: 不求认同
Segment #100 [00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:15,920] | Words: 4  | Text: 你的时间很贵
Segment #101 [00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:16,680] | Words: 4  | Text: 经历很贵
Segment #102 [00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 人生很贵
Segment #103 [00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,980] | Words: 9  | Text: 不要浪费在无关的对错
Segment #104 [00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:19,940] | Words: 6  | Text: 无谓的书营上
Segment #105 [00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:20,880] | Words: 4  | Text: 把所有资源
Segment #106 [00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,560] | Words: 9  | Text: 全部投入到能让你成长
Segment #107 [00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,520] | Words: 5  | Text: 能让你增值
Segment #108 [00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,020] | Words: 7  | Text: 能让你变好的事情上
Segment #109 [00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:26,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 弱者困于情绪
Segment #110 [00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,000] | Words: 4  | Text: 困于对错
Segment #111 [00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:27,920] | Words: 4  | Text: 困于面子
Segment #112 [00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,360] | Words: 6  | Text: 强者谋于取捨
Segment #113 [00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,260] | Words: 4  | Text: 谋于长远
Segment #114 [00:02:30,260 --> 00:02:31,180] | Words: 4  | Text: 谋于结果
Segment #115 [00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,840] | Words: 5  | Text: 弱者论对错
Segment #116 [00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,280] | Words: 5  | Text: 强者论取捨
